'''Offshore Accounts''' (ボンボンネコボンネコボンボン, ''Bon Bon Nekobon Neko Bon Bon'', '''Bon Bon Nekobon Cat Bon Bon''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 9.9 Update|Version 9.9]].

==Effect==
Starting Money UP (M): Wallet starts with 500¢.

